  sentences:
    nameNPC: Ta
    Lines:
    - "Ba ti\u1EBFng tr\u1ED1ng ng\u1EAFn. C\u1EDD hi\u1EC7u \u0110inh h\u1EA1 n\u1EEDa
      \u0111\u1ED1t. N\u1ECF k\xE9o d\xE2y, gi\xE1o h\u1EA1 ngang h\xF4ng. Tr\xEAn
      v\u1ECDng l\xE2u, k\xE8n s\u1EEBng ng\xE2n d\xE0i \u0111\xE1p l\u1EA1i. Lau
      trong thung l\u0169ng rung \u0111\u1ED3ng lo\u1EA1t. Kh\xF4ng ai b\u01B0\u1EDBc
      tr\u01B0\u1EDBc. Kh\xF4ng ai r\xFAt lui. M\xE0n m\u1EDF \u0111\xE3 c\u0103ng
      d\xE2y."
